  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1mJMKF859BvjTD0X8xh50RJAU10mYlxkL=w2520-h1330-iv1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"240\"><br><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aw/settings/Apocalypse w\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fromano_catello%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brskatm123</a> 开发</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新矿物</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><br><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/my-drive\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1L86b-H5_nHpBjWyQXvJIsJ-QpUDQT7n2=w2520-h1368-iv1\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"97\"></strong></em></span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\">暗元素矿石生成于基岩附近</span></strong></span>（钻石下方）</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\">火元素矿石生成于下界</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\">水元素矿石生成于海洋生物群系</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\">光元素矿石生成于沙漠生物群系</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>土元素矿石生成于森林生物群系</strong></span></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><strong>新植物</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1bAVDhFGfFU8g41dWyYsBjv5K2nlfyFvV=w1864-h991-iv2\" alt=\"\" width=\"383\" height=\"79\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#800080;font-size:14px\"><strong>暗植物生成于山地生物群系</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>火植物生成于下界的灵魂沙上</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>水植物生成于海滩生物群系附近</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>光植物生成于沙漠生物群系</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>土植物生成于森林生物群系</strong></span></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新特殊武器</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1iMZ_4TwTLPLFtezI4Mp9eahUYQtF24Fd=w2520-h1330-iv5\" alt=\"\" width=\"367\" height=\"83\"></span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>死亡之锤消耗 1 个暗尘</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>炼狱斧消耗 1 个火尘</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#0cf\"><strong>海啸剑消耗 1 个水尘</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#fc0\"><strong>雷霆矛消耗 1 个光尘</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008000;font-size:14px\"><strong>地震镰刀消耗 1 个土尘</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f00\"><strong>右键点击方块或空中可释放技能，（仅 1.12/1.14/1.15 版本消耗尘土）</strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>护甲、方块、工具（剑、镐、锹、斧和锄）以及木棍的合成配方与原版 Minecraft 相同。</strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>最新更新功能：</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:xx-small\"><strong>1.2.9</strong></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:xx-small\"><strong>新材质，更改了特殊武器的超能力，修复了大量错误，新增动态方块和植物，现在特殊武器不再消耗尘土但冷却时间增加，移除了彩虹锭及其所有相关合成物品。修复了工具伤害问题，并为基础剑添加了新效果。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:12px\"><strong>强烈建议搭配 Just Enough Items 或 Not Enough Items 模组游玩，以便查看单个物品的合成配方</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>",
